//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// HOW CENTRAL ECONOMY INTERACTS WITH BUILDS
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*
CE SYSTEM FLOW:

1. mapgroupproto spawns buildings + containers
2. server starts economy system
3. types.xml fills containers
4. players loot containers

IMPORTANT:
Without types.xml setup → containers stay empty
*/



//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// BEST PRACTICE DESIGN RULES
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*

GOOD DESIGN:

- Place loot containers INSIDE cover
- Avoid open-field loot spam
- Mix military + civilian props
- Use spacing for realism
- Limit group density for performance

BAD DESIGN:

- stacking 50 crates in one spot
- floating buildings
- overlapping groups
- unrealistic loot clusters
*/



//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// COMMON ERROR SYSTEM
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*

ERROR 1:
Group exists in proto but NOT in pos
→ nothing spawns

ERROR 2:
Wrong classname in child
→ object missing silently

ERROR 3:
No loot defined in types.xml
→ empty containers

ERROR 4:
Too many groups in one area
→ server lag

ERROR 5:
Bad coords (outside map)
→ nothing appears
*/



